; tw-pubconnector

tw-pubconnector is a literature workflow plugin for TiddlyWiki. It combines publication sync, article reading, citation discovery, and browser-assisted capture in one plugin.

!! Included features

* Retrieve and cache publication data for tiddlers tagged `Colleague` from OpenAlex, ORCID, Google Scholar, Web of Science, and Scopus.
* Import BibTeX entries and connect DOI-backed papers to existing author tiddlers through [[PubConnector|https://github.com/byzheng/PubConnector]].
* Upload publisher HTML and reopen articles in a cleaner TiddlyWiki reading view through [[SingleFile|https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/singlefile/mpiodijhokgodhhofbcjdecpffjipkle]] and [[PubConnector|https://github.com/byzheng/PubConnector]].
* Highlight article text, save notes, and review saved notes later with a dedicated widget.
* Auto-link article text back to wiki concepts using configurable Domain filters and aliases.
* Show latest publications, references, citing papers, and highlight notes with widgets.
* Track new citations for watched papers or colleagues with Citation Watch.
* Communicate with [[PubConnector|https://github.com/byzheng/PubConnector]] for browser workflows such as opening tiddlers, importing records, and handling captured images.

