;Code and demo

For learning plugin features, syntax, tutorial and examples see the plugin demo and code pages

* Demo: https://tw-pubconnector.bangyou.me
* Code: https://github.com/byzheng/tw-pubconnector

!! Runtime notes

* Most routes require TiddlyWiki on Node.js.
* BibTeX import depends on `$:/plugins/tiddlywiki/bibtex`.
* Some authoring providers require API keys or browser-assisted workflows.
* Saved article HTML workflows are designed around SingleFile and PubConnector.

